<div class="free-magic-sheet-panel-inner">
  <div class="fm-sheet-header">
    <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-nodes" aria-hidden="true"></i> Свободная Магия</h2>
    <button type="button" class="fm-sheet-close" title="Свернуть">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </button>
  </div>

  <nav class="fm-sheet-tabs">
    <button type="button" class="fm-sheet-tab-btn" data-tab="paths">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-route" aria-hidden="true"></i> Пути Магии
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="fm-sheet-tab-btn" data-tab="modifiers">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders" aria-hidden="true"></i> Модификаторы
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="fm-sheet-tab-btn" data-tab="tags">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-tags" aria-hidden="true"></i> Тэги
    </button>
  </nav>

  <div class="fm-sheet-body">
    <section class="fm-sheet-tab-panel" data-tab-panel="paths">
      <div class="fm-sheet-profile-row">
        <div class="fm-sheet-profile-field" data-field="element">
          <span class="fm-sheet-profile-label">Элемент</span>
          <span class="fm-sheet-profile-value"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-sheet-profile-field" data-field="circle">
          <span class="fm-sheet-profile-label">Круг</span>
          <span class="fm-sheet-profile-value"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-sheet-profile-field" data-field="type">
          <span class="fm-sheet-profile-label">Тип</span>
          <span class="fm-sheet-profile-value"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="fm-sheet-profile-field" data-field="limit">
          <span class="fm-sheet-profile-label">Закл. Лимит</span>
          <span class="fm-sheet-profile-value"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3>Токены Путей</h3>
      <p class="fm-sheet-hint">База — вручную. Бонус — сумма всех предметов с меткой этого Пути (в т.ч. от Skill Tree). Итого — то, что видит окно Круга.</p>
      <div class="fm-sheet-paths-list"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="fm-sheet-tab-panel" data-tab-panel="modifiers" hidden>
      <div class="fm-sheet-modifiers-tab-body"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="fm-sheet-tab-panel" data-tab-panel="tags" hidden>
      <div class="fm-sheet-tags-list"></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
